{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12428","headline":"题延州圣僧穴 · 钱起","name":"题延州圣僧穴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"定力无涯不可称，未知何代坐禅僧。\n默默山门宵闭月，荧荧石壁昼然灯。\n四时树长书经叶，万岁岩悬拄杖藤。\n昔日舍身缘救鸽，今时出见有飞鹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}